  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Municipal Twinning Cooperation Programme - Ukraine and Denmark</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to contribute to the reconstruction and future development of Mykolaiv and other Ukrainian cities by enhancing the capacity of authorities to participatory respond to needs and rights of citizens. The project will facilitate twinning cooperation between Danish and Ukrainian municipalities with main partner municipality in Ukraine is Mykolaiv city/region, but also Lviv, Kiev and a few smaller municipalities with whom Danish municipalities have already established contact and/cooperation are included. Each cooperation is defined by the Ukrainian and Danish partner municipalities, however water management, energy efficiency, waste management, rehabilitation (veterans/traumatised persons), business development and youth/democracy are themes in the partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
